    <item>
      <title>JUST IN: Jensen Huang releases statement after being reinstated as Nvidia $NVDA </title>
      <link>https://t.me/WatcherGuru/16277</link>
      <description>&lt;div class="tgme_widget_message_text js-message_text" dir="auto"&gt;&lt;div class="tgme_widget_message_text js-message_text" dir="auto"&gt;&lt;b&gt;JUST IN: &lt;/b&gt;Jensen Huang releases statement after being reinstated as Nvidia $NVDA CEO. &lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;"I am honoured to return to Nvidia and lead one of the most consequential technology companies in the world at the beginning of a new industrial revolution.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;I take this responsibility with the greatest humility and renewed commitment.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;I want to thank the Nvidia board for its confidence and deliberation through this process. I am especially grateful to Harvey Jones for his leadership as chair, and to Colette Kress and our executive staff for leading Nvidia during this period.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;I am also deeply thankful to our employees, shareholders, leaders across the industry and partners around the world for their extraordinary support. Above all, I am grateful for the love and support of my family. I can't wait to get back to work."&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;i class="emoji" style="background-image:url('//telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F93B0.png')"&gt;&lt;b&gt;📰&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/i&gt; &lt;a href="https://watcherguru.com/" rel="noopener" target="_blank"&gt;https://watcherguru.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;a href="https://t.me/WatcherGuru" target="_blank"&gt;@WatcherGuru&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://cdn1.telesco.pe/file/CXPj8n_BZgdrlcG6KyTT73l01jrKgQW0WxbUsNcqLCtsB6mlojXJ0cYEqcYdA-0-0lohn5YX3d4Uoje6qP9c1lWyxb4d4ktUmMsLWBeyg3l9RhvkRCMIr9MfkajHqUjAXXU4S-RafNu2rPYFLCKyvkAWyaFrW-Fdn7LwNDcj54zIS2s7WX5VwdPgMm8cRmb6iGZW7dtGxoLtqtDeCe8BdXhSv4Pjnbid4qfXaHy1YUyGfP9bCHFnQCdylm31I5ZcPJLpJ2W6pn1Jk3TrX6yJL9yo7ZSh8TAcvRGIcBxDFOiaDc9cCCL4Gqn3RG1tH0R_Ih4rLXFu9yEER51f0V3Oiw.jpg" alt="Telegram post image" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://cdn1.telesco.pe/file/DzqV1QrTVgkaqr7Fnq0pyEtSK681MivOw4yTKOjsswJZuGOvV15b2TUvKHOgbeypA-IsY7-0YfiqEISF4CqIrBRKFHb-2YdwBF_GDz4J9MH3lQOCwRDR29v3-eAClYcKKXj1rAcbMX_4Fc2E53rxpOELp1aJMDsjOhcE35VK9WBvc4KY94KxhC0N5SKFN0Pd8D25nlcfXF9ZsH8b4rcrLIG9EbZGRvQP027sxTg3F5QCckaYOsyYkaAUv1gycEPUVfs_kOvcOOd9vU2CvY6ELGXi5-2G7S06rb6iVfv-F7dUpguj-BQbA2Eh71XC4QnReWVjJImSQdw1lSwXqkgRJQ.jpg" alt="Telegram post image" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
      <content:encoded>&lt;div class="tgme_widget_message_text js-message_text" dir="auto"&gt;&lt;div class="tgme_widget_message_text js-message_text" dir="auto"&gt;&lt;b&gt;JUST IN: &lt;/b&gt;Jensen Huang releases statement after being reinstated as Nvidia $NVDA CEO. &lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;"I am honoured to return to Nvidia and lead one of the most consequential technology companies in the world at the beginning of a new industrial revolution.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;I take this responsibility with the greatest humility and renewed commitment.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;I want to thank the Nvidia board for its confidence and deliberation through this process. I am especially grateful to Harvey Jones for his leadership as chair, and to Colette Kress and our executive staff for leading Nvidia during this period.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;I am also deeply thankful to our employees, shareholders, leaders across the industry and partners around the world for their extraordinary support. Above all, I am grateful for the love and support of my family. I can't wait to get back to work."&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;i class="emoji" style="background-image:url('//telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F93B0.png')"&gt;&lt;b&gt;📰&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/i&gt; &lt;a href="https://watcherguru.com/" rel="noopener" target="_blank"&gt;https://watcherguru.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;a href="https://t.me/WatcherGuru" target="_blank"&gt;@WatcherGuru&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
